# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rust / Cargo
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled output and build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk          # rustfmt backup files
*.pdb               # debug symbols (Windows)

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored.
# LinkForge is a binary/application, so COMMIT Cargo.lock
# for reproducible builds. (Libraries would ignore it.)

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & environment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.env                # local secrets — NEVER commit
.env.*.local
*.local

# Keep the committed template:
!.env.example

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# sqlx
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local SQLite dev DB (if used before Postgres migration)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# NOTE: the .sqlx/ directory (offline query cache) SHOULD be
# committed so CI can build without a live database.
# So we do NOT ignore it.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker / Postgres
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local volume data if you ever bind-mount instead of using named volumes
/pgdata/
/redisdata/
docker-compose.override.yml   # personal local overrides

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Observability / runtime output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
/logs/
/tmp/

# Benchmark & profiling output
/criterion/
*.perf
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors & IDEs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/.idea/             # JetBrains (RustRover, CLion)
/.vscode/           # VS Code — or keep shared settings (see note below)
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS files
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store           # macOS
Thumbs.db           # Windows
desktop.ini